---
description: React component conventions
globs: ["src/components/**/*.tsx", "src/app/**/*.tsx"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Use server components by default
- Client components require 'use client' at top
- Props interface must be defined above the component
- Use Tailwind CSS v4 classes, never raw HTML elements for UI style overrides
- No useEffect for data fetching — use server components or SWR
